---
Signs in and manages cloud accounts, projects, environments and tokens

Usage: leptoskit cloud [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  login    Signs in through your browser with a short code
  logout   Revokes your login and removes the local credentials
  whoami   Shows who is signed in and which organizations they can see
  org      Manages organizations and membership
  project  Manages projects and their production environment
  env      Manages a project's environments
  token    Manages scoped API tokens for CI
  link     Links leptoskit.toml to an existing cloud project
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --app-target <NAME>  Select a named target from the root leptoskit.toml
      --url <URL>          Cloud origin; overrides `LEPTOSKIT_CLOUD_URL` and [cloud].url
      --json               Prints the documented JSON result
      --org <ORG>          Organization slug; defaults to [cloud].organization or your personal one
      --project <PROJECT>  Project slug; defaults to [cloud].project
  -h, --help               Print help
  -V, --version            Print version
